    {
      "name": "reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT210eFMwOVJSbkkxWjFwNWMzbFZhRmQwY2pkSU9WRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 недели назад",
      "rating": 1,
      "text": {
        "text": "Worst hospital I’ve ever gone too. And that’s saying a lot considering I’ve been stuck in hospital in multiple continents, including Africa. Nurses/doctors, especially from the second shift were extremely rude, didn’t want to answer my questions on my health status, basically just wanted to get my money and put us to the door. They didn’t even ask how I was feeling, kept telling them I hit my head really hard and didn’t want to give me a CT scan… a whole nightmare. And if that wasn’t enough, they called the police to drag us out of the hospital as I was still too weak to walk on my own, simply wanting to get a few questions answered on my medical state which they never bother to answer. Left the hospital in the same condition I came in. Worst worst experience EVER. Also had like 2-3 patients for 5-6 doctors so not like they were super busy… they found it funny and amusing that the police showed up to take us outside the hospital??? Never really checked to lower my fever has I was shivering almost the entire time I was there.. don’t go there!",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Worst hospital I’ve ever gone too. And that’s saying a lot considering I’ve been stuck in hospital in multiple continents, including Africa. Nurses/doctors, especially from the second shift were extremely rude, didn’t want to answer my questions on my health status, basically just wanted to get my money and put us to the door. They didn’t even ask how I was feeling, kept telling them I hit my head really hard and didn’t want to give me a CT scan… a whole nightmare. And if that wasn’t enough, they called the police to drag us out of the hospital as I was still too weak to walk on my own, simply wanting to get a few questions answered on my medical state which they never bother to answer. Left the hospital in the same condition I came in. Worst worst experience EVER. Also had like 2-3 patients for 5-6 doctors so not like they were super busy… they found it funny and amusing that the police showed up to take us outside the hospital??? Never really checked to lower my fever has I was shivering almost the entire time I was there.. don’t go there!",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
